# Local database + secrets
# Keep every SQLite sidecar here: tooling that walks the project (Tailwind's
# class scanner, for one) honours this file, and the -shm/-wal files are locked
# while the app is running.
data/*.db
data/*.db-journal
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
